# Wolf Society - Client Connection Environment
# Since this application operates 100% on pure static HTML, CSS, and JS:
# Your Supabase URL and Anon API key are linked secure-cache in index.html and admin.html.
# You can easily configure these directly within the application in real-time or by
# writing them directly to the js/supabase-config.js variables WOLF_SUPABASE_URL and WOLF_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY.

SUPABASE_URL="https://yourproject.supabase.co"
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
ADMIN_USERNAME="admin"
ADMIN_PASSWORD="wolf-society-secure-pass"
